sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant fsm as FiniteStateMachine
    participant king as King : State
    participant t as Transition(King→Normal)
    participant guard as Guard
    participant exitAction as King.exit : Action
    participant normal as Normal : State
    participant enterAction as Normal.enter : Action

    Note over Client,enterAction: Sample 1（不巢狀）：King 狀態收到 king-stop 事件

    Client ->> fsm: fire(event)
    fsm ->> king: fire(event)
    king -->> fsm: false（單純狀態，永遠交給外層處理）

    fsm ->> t: isApplicable(currentState=king, event)
    t ->> guard: isSatisfied(event)
    guard -->> t: true
    t -->> fsm: true（找到可執行的轉移）

    fsm ->> king: onExit(event)
    king ->> exitAction: execute(event)

    Note right of fsm: 更新 currentState = Normal

    fsm ->> normal: onEnter(event)
    normal ->> enterAction: execute(event)

    fsm -->> Client: true（轉移成功）
